    alias: builtbyaarya
repository-code: https://github.com/builtbyaarya/us-solar-trade-tracker
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: "2026.10.21"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
keywords:
  - solar
  - antidumping
  - countervailing duty
  - manufacturing capacity
  - trade policy
abstract: >-
  An open, row-by-row sourced dataset of US antidumping and countervailing duty rates on
  crystalline silicon solar cells and modules (by case, country, company, stage and date,
  AD and CVD separately, with Section 201 and 301 layers) and of US solar and battery
  manufacturing capacity by stage with status and cancellations. Code is MIT licensed.
